# What I would physically do to the repo

I would **not delete the historical source material yet**.

The original corpus is valuable archaeology.

But make it impossible for coding agents to confuse it with current requirements:

```text
/archive/original/
```

Then write six authoritative documents:

| Canonical doc       | Derived from                                |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| `VISION.md`         | thesis + overview                           |
| `GAME_RULES.md`     | gameplay prompt + latest MVP                |
| `AGENT_MODEL.md`    | actually-good-blades + persistence material |
