| `EVOLUTION.md`      | latest MVP + useful Gen/PZL concepts        |
| `MEDIA_PIPELINE.md` | overview + latest cinematic architecture    |

Then place a huge banner in archive README:

```text
HISTORICAL SOURCE MATERIAL.
NOT CURRENT IMPLEMENTATION SPEC.
