Because right now an autonomous coding agent reading the repo could very plausibly decide that it needs:

```text
PennyLane + Qiskit + IPFS + Orch-OR + GNN +
viscoelastic swarms + fine-tuned Phi-3
```

before it implements two spinning cylinders.

That would be catastrophic.

